tt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-94cc693 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"94cc693\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43dce79 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"43dce79\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">nttttt<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><span style=\'color:  #63707C;font-size:\'>u00b7</span> About Us</p>tttt</div>ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e59da7e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e59da7e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">nttttt<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Who is  <span class=\"gradient-text\">Sumit Kumar?</span></h2>tttt</div>ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f8daa1 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5f8daa1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">nttttt<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">\"Helping businesses grow with creative web design and development solutions.\"</p>tttt</div>ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d84f506 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d84f506\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">nttttt<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Hi, I\'m Sumit Kumar, a passionate WordPress Developer &amp; Web Designer dedicated to transforming ideas into modern, responsive, and visually engaging websites. I specialize in creating user-friendly digital experiences that not only look attractive but also deliver real business results.</p>tttt</div>ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-345ba9